<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>CPP-API: Abstract interface for logger implementations. <link linkend="_namespace_assimp">Assimp</link> provides a default implementation and uses it for almost all logging stuff (&apos;<link linkend="_class_assimp_1_1_default_logger">DefaultLogger</link>&apos;). This class defines just basic logging behavior and is not of interest for you. Instead, take a look at #DefaultLogger. </para>
</section>
